# VSCodium is a live Electron profile – only track real user config.
# Everything else is cache / machine-specific state.

# ── Chromium / Electron caches ──
Cache/
Code Cache/
GPUCache/
DawnGraphiteCache/
DawnWebGPUCache/
blob_storage/
CachedData/
CachedConfigurations/
CachedExtensionVSIXs/
CachedProfilesData/
Crashpad/
Dictionaries/
Service Worker/
Session Storage/
Shared Dictionary/
WebStorage/
Local Storage/
Backups/

# ── Machine / identity / browsing state – never commit ──
Cookies
Cookies-journal
DIPS
Preferences
Local State
Network Persistent State
TransportSecurity
Trust Tokens
Trust Tokens-journal
SharedStorage
machineid
languagepacks.json

# ── VSCode workspace / extension runtime state ──
User/History/
User/workspaceStorage/
User/globalStorage/
*.vscdb
*.vscdb.backup
*.log
